 "sentences": [
  "She was history's first professional female balloonist.",
  "Sophie Blanchard made over 60 balloon ascents throughout Europe.",
  "Napoleon Bonaparte even appointed her his official aeronaut for festivals.",
  "But ballooning was incredibly risky for early pioneers.",
  "She endured freezing temperatures and once nearly drowned in a marsh.",
  "Tragically, her balloon caught fire during a 1819 exhibition, causing her fatal crash."
